atlas meta-edge-algebra
# The typed meta-edge algebra. A generic `A -> B` edge is prohibited. Every edge
# in the plural graph estate specializes exactly one of these bounded meta-classes,
# so the graph may hold millions of domain edge types while the machinery only
# has to understand ~16 edge classes. Domain edges declare their class; the class
# fixes the algebra (transitivity, symmetry, causality, temporality, authority,
# proof obligations) the machinery may assume.

edge_class IDENTITY
  meaning are these the same object (byte / structural / derivational / real-world)?
  specialized_by hashes_to
  specialized_by canon_equivalent
  specialized_by same_actor

edge_class SEMANTIC
  meaning what does this mean in relation to that (typed, not transitive by default)?
  specialized_by is_a
  specialized_by part_of

edge_class AUTHORITY
  meaning who may do what, to what, for what purpose, until when?
  specialized_by may_approve
  specialized_by delegates
  specialized_by revokes

edge_class EVIDENCE
  meaning does this support / contradict / reproduce that claim?
  specialized_by supports_claim
  specialized_by contradicts

edge_class CAUSAL
  meaning does this cause / enable / unlock that (possibly non-monotonic)?
  specialized_by unlocks
  specialized_by triggers

edge_class DEPENDENCY
  meaning does this require that to proceed?
  specialized_by depends_on
  specialized_by blocked_by

edge_class CAPABILITY
  meaning does this require / provide that capability?
  specialized_by requires_capability
  specialized_by provides_capability

edge_class PROVIDER
  meaning can this realize that capability, at what metric?
  specialized_by realizes
  specialized_by falls_back_to

edge_class PLACEMENT
  meaning where does this run / reside?
  specialized_by placed_on
  specialized_by resident_in

edge_class TEMPORAL
  meaning how do these order in time (event / effective / retrieval / supersession)?
  specialized_by precedes
  specialized_by supersedes

edge_class ECONOMIC
  meaning what value / cost / commitment flows here (no implicit cash conversion)?
  specialized_by funds
  specialized_by commits

edge_class INSTITUTIONAL
  meaning what institutional membership / scope / delegation holds?
  specialized_by member_of
  specialized_by scoped_to

edge_class PROVENANCE
  meaning where did this come from, through what path?
  specialized_by derived_from
  specialized_by produced_by

edge_class PROJECTION
  meaning how does this project into another estate / app without becoming it?
  specialized_by projects_to

edge_class EXECUTION
  meaning what actually ran this, producing what witness?
  specialized_by executed_by
  specialized_by carried_by

edge_class LEARNING
  meaning what pattern / promotion / structural change does this feed?
  specialized_by clusters_into
  specialized_by promotes_to
